  "notes": [
    "**Arremeter** is a regular **-ER verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **arremetido** (regular)",
    "Often used with \"contra\": *arremeter contra alguien* (to attack/charge at someone)",
    "Can be physical (attack, charge) or verbal (lash out, criticize harshly)",
    "Common usage:",
    "*El toro arremetió contra el torero* (The bull charged at the bullfighter)",
    "*Arremetió contra sus críticos* (He/She lashed out at his/her critics)",
    "Related noun: **la arremetida** (attack, charge, onslaught)",
    "More formal/literary than everyday speech"
  ],
